Package: homie
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Kurt Schwarz <kurt@schw.ar>
Depends: avahi-daemon, ca-certificates, cage, chromium, curl, ddcutil, fontconfig, libnss-mdns, network-manager, systemd
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Family calendar, weather, and photo wall kiosk
 Homie runs on a Raspberry Pi behind a touchscreen: the shared calendar,
 the weather, and a slow rotation of family photos.
